<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's TCV bond tender yields 7.9875 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's TCV bond tender yields 7.9875 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corp of Victoria (TCV) said on Wednesday its tender of its 10.25 percent November 2006 stock produced an weighted average yield (WAY) of 7.9875 percent.</p>
</text>
